OL,3,GNEWSATwo women on Romanian dog rescue
OL,4,Adie in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo British women have been killed in a
OL,7,Fcrash in Romania.
OL,9,FRachael Harvey-Purkiss, from Essex, and
OL,10,Fa woman from Northamptonshire were in a
OL,11,Fcollision which, according to reports,
OL,12,Finvolved multiple vehicles near the
OL,13,FSerbian border on Thursday.
OL,15,FThe women were in the country to
OL,16,Fcollect street dogs on behalf of
OL,17,FUK-based animal rescue Homeward Bound.
OL,18,FIt is understood a number of dogs also
OL,19,Fperished in the crash.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
